# Domatar Spec Docs

- Living public specs are Markdown under `docs/spec/` (WHAT and WHY,
  present-tense, with "Direction" subsections for future work).
- Phased `Update-*.txt` build plans live in the sibling `internal`
  workspace root, not in this repository. Do not create them here.

## Status markers

Specs carry a status at the top, flipped as work lands:

- `[DESIGN — not yet implemented]`
- `[IMPLEMENTED — <Update-...>.txt]`

## Conventions

- Structure with `PART N` sections. Public specs use GitHub Markdown
  headings (`#` / `## PART N`).
- Reference companion specs by path under `docs/spec/` instead of
  duplicating their content (duplication drifts).
- Record deliberate deviations from a plan as KEY DECISIONS (KD1, KD2, …)
  in the internal Update file and fold them back into the living spec.
- When you implement or change behavior, update the relevant spec(s) in
  the same change (status marker + cross-refs).
